3. Summary of Substantive Modifications for Google Antigravity:
   - Antigravity Schema & Orchestration: Reorganized skills into native
     `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (auto-discovered + `/<name>` slash commands),
     added trigger-scoped rules (`always_on`, `model_decision`, `glob`), fixed
     single-revision post-earnings agent order, restored interactive/subagent
     human review checkpoints, and sharpened overlapping skill descriptions.
   - DCF & Valuation Methodology Fixes: Replaced `Net Debt / EV` WACC weights
     with gross-debt market weights `E/(E+D)` and `D/(E+D)`, unified the canonical
     2-sheet `DCF` + `WACC` layout (`Case` at `DCF!B4`, vertically stacked
     Bear/Base/Bull blocks + `INDEX` consolidation, live centered 5x5 sensitivity
     formulas matching `build_dcf_skeleton.py`), enforced mid-year explicit UFCF
     (`t - 0.5`) and mid-year perpetuity TV (`(1 + WACC)^(N - 0.5)`) discounting
     with strict end-of-year `(1 + WACC)^N` exit-multiple TV discounting,
     capped terminal growth to `<= 3.5%` / long-term nominal GDP, completed the
     EV-to-equity bridge with ASC 842 operating lease double-counting warnings,
     required TSM/if-converted diluted shares and SBC expense treatment, and
     fixed worked-example arithmetic and precedent-transaction weighting in
     `initiating-coverage`.
   - 3-Statement & GAAP Accounting Fixes: Added scratch-build support alongside
     template completion, GAAP ASC 740 NOL/DTA accounting, complete equity
     roll-forwards (SBC/APIC, Treasury Stock/buybacks, AOCI), revolver minimum-cash
     sweep, explicit SBC/D&A functional OpEx double-counting prevention, and
     Python/`openpyxl` iterative/non-circular handling.
   - Comps & Unit Economics Fixes: Enforced full EV formula, NTM calendarization,
     `IFERROR(..., "NM")` denominator guards, corrected decimal PEG scaling,
     replaced impossible illustrative benchmark margins, adapted `unit-economics`
     for public equities with lagged CAC, explicit GRR/NDR/payback/Rule of 40
     alignment, and a 5-tab `.xlsx` architecture.
   - Research Integrity, Drafts-Only & Consensus Guardrails: Enforced drafts-only
     labeling (`DRAFT — FOR INTERNAL ANALYST REVIEW ONLY`), mandatory Disclosures
     appendix, non-fabricated analyst review placeholders, no-fabrication target
     ranges, strict pre-print consensus source hierarchy (prohibiting post-print
     Yahoo Finance and unverified whisper numbers), explicit in-line thresholds,
     and `[ASSUMPTION]` / `[UNSOURCED]` / `[NOT SCREENED — ANALYST IDEA]` tags.
   - Python Programmatic Authoring & QA Tooling: Replaced Claude/Office JS/Cowork
     GUI flows with Python (`openpyxl`, `python-docx`, `python-pptx`, `matplotlib`,
     `seaborn`, `pypdf`), LibreOffice recalculation/audit (`recalc_xlsx.py` with
     `--check-only`, `--output`, and `unverified` exit 2), and CI regression tests.
